---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Pricing for Products and Services"
  description="Current M8tcha subscription pricing, billing intervals, and purchase terms."
>
  <p>
    M8tcha can be used to discover people, join Rooms, and connect socially. We may also offer
    optional M8tcha Premium subscriptions with additional features. The prices below are the
    current standard USD offers configured for the Services as of the date above.
  </p>

  <h2>Current Premium Plans</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Plan</th><th>Price</th><th>Billing</th><th>Includes</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Premium Weekly</td><td>$19.99</td><td>Every 7 days</td><td>Unlimited likes, see who liked you, advanced filters</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Premium Monthly</td><td>$69.99</td><td>Every month</td><td>Unlimited likes, see who liked you, one boost per month, advanced filters</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Premium Quarterly</td><td>$179.99</td><td>Every 3 months</td><td>Unlimited likes, see who liked you, two boosts per month, advanced filters</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Premium Yearly</td><td>$599.99</td><td>Every year</td><td>Unlimited likes, see who liked you, four boosts per month, advanced filters, priority support</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Prices are in U.S. dollars and are before any applicable taxes unless the checkout screen says
    otherwise. The final price, currency, taxes, promotional offer, and available payment method
    shown at checkout control the transaction. Prices may vary by country, platform, or storefront.
    We will not charge you without your confirmation of the displayed offer.
  </p>

  <h2>Billing and Cancellation</h2>
  <p>
    Subscriptions renew automatically for the same interval until canceled. Stripe payments are
    processed through Stripe Checkout and can be managed in the Stripe Customer Portal. Apple and
    Google purchases are managed through the applicable store. Cancel before the next renewal date to
    avoid the next charge; cancellation normally takes effect at the end of the paid period.
  </p>
  <p>
    See our{' '}<a href="/legal/terms">Terms of Service</a>{' '}and{' '}
    <a href="/legal/refunds">Refund Policy</a>{' '}for
    renewal, cancellation, statutory withdrawal, and refund terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Payment Processing</h2>
  <p>
    Stripe, Apple, and Google process payments under their own terms and privacy policies. M8tcha
    does not store full payment card numbers. We receive billing status and transaction information
    needed to provide Premium, prevent fraud, provide support, and comply with accounting and legal
    obligations.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
